  "description": "Nami's Tidecaller's Blessing as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): the main pack's blessing gives the healed ally 15% attack and ability power for 4 s and slows the enemies her stream hits, because data cannot read another champion's hits; with this add-on the blessed ally's (or her own) next 3 attacks or abilities within 6 s each deal 50 + 20% of Nami's ability power bonus magic damage and slow 25% for 1 s, and the stream itself no longer slows. Everything else stays the main pack's. Writes a log for testing.",
